| M1-B1：完了したdevelopment map | [bounded契約](../pr2_matched_accuracy_m1_b1_bounded_compile_contract_v1.md)、[source-first amendment](../pr2_matched_accuracy_m1_b1_execution_contract_amendment_v2.md)、[実行認可](../pr2_matched_accuracy_m1_b1_execution_authorization_v1.md) | [結果検証](../../pr2_matched_accuracy_m1_b1_result_validation.md)、[認可前レビュー](../pr2_m1_b1_execution_authorization_external_review_request_8fc2400.md) |
| M1-A：compile-free評価 | [実装契約](../pr2_matched_accuracy_m1_implementation_contract_v1.md)、[hard barrier](../pr2_matched_accuracy_m1_preexecution_amendment_v2.md)、[再認可v1.1](../pr2_matched_accuracy_m1_execution_authorization_v1_1.md) | [SELECTION_LIMITED報告](../../pr2_matched_accuracy_m1_a_validation.md)、[停止後レビュー](../pr2_m1_a_selection_limited_external_review_request_3c1831e.md) |
| S2：旧fixed-q development比較 | [authorization v5](../pr2_v4_s2_development_authorization_v5.md) | [V4/S2結果](../../pr2_v4_s2_development_validation.md) |
